1
00:00:05,960 --> 00:00:07,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Dad.</b></font>

2
00:00:07,090 --> 00:00:08,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uh!</b></font>

3
00:00:08,430 --> 00:00:09,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I get it.</b></font>

4
00:00:09,890 --> 00:00:11,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This all scares you.</b></font>

5
00:00:12,180 --> 00:00:13,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But I am not going anywhere.</b></font>

6
00:00:14,470 --> 00:00:15,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can take care of myself.</b></font>

7
00:00:16,270 --> 00:00:17,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can do more than you know.</b></font>

8
00:00:18,310 --> 00:00:20,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Please don't worry anymore.</b></font>

9
00:00:20,310 --> 00:00:21,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I promise I'll be fine.</b></font>

10
00:00:23,110 --> 00:00:24,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Of course,</b></font>

11
00:00:24,570 --> 00:00:25,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I still need you.</b></font>

12
00:00:26,940 --> 00:00:28,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But I am going back on Monday.</b></font>

13
00:00:29,070 --> 00:00:30,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hachimitsu's my home.</b></font>

14
00:00:32,660 --> 00:00:33,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA'S DAD]
Uka.</b></font>

15
00:00:34,280 --> 00:00:35,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Lift your head.</b></font>

16
00:00:35,660 --> 00:00:36,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

17
00:00:38,160 --> 00:00:40,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I apologize
for the misunderstanding.</b></font>

18
00:00:40,920 --> 00:00:42,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Please, look after my daughter.</b></font>

19
00:00:44,920 --> 00:00:46,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] So.
How'd I do?</b></font>

20
00:00:47,050 --> 00:00:48,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Nailed it.</b></font>

21
00:00:49,220 --> 00:00:50,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Dad.</b></font>

22
00:00:51,340 --> 00:00:52,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Mom.</b></font>

23
00:00:53,180 --> 00:00:54,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This is it.</b></font>

24
00:00:55,560 --> 00:00:57,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This is the new world
I've found.</b></font>

25
00:00:58,140 --> 00:01:00,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

26
00:01:00,940 --> 00:01:03,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[birds chirping]</b></font>

27
00:01:04,020 --> 00:01:05,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Uka sighs]</b></font>

28
00:01:06,690 --> 00:01:09,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] I was too excited
and got here early.</b></font>

29
00:01:09,440 --> 00:01:11,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Looks like I'm the first one.</b></font>

30
00:01:13,070 --> 00:01:15,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Feels like I've done
this exact thing before.</b></font>

31
00:01:18,200 --> 00:01:19,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Let's use this time
to rehearse.</b></font>

32
00:01:20,830 --> 00:01:22,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hi!
I'm so sorry</b></font>

33
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:24,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>for worrying everyone
last week! I...</b></font>

34
00:01:24,290 --> 00:01:25,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sighs]</b></font>

35
00:01:25,460 --> 00:01:26,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
My voice cracked.</b></font>

36
00:01:27,460 --> 00:01:29,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI] Feels like
we've done this before.</b></font>

37
00:01:29,670 --> 00:01:30,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What do you think?</b></font>

38
00:01:30,970 --> 00:01:32,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Huh?</b></font>

39
00:01:33,430 --> 00:01:34,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

40
00:01:35,100 --> 00:01:36,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh.
Hey,</b></font>

41
00:01:37,350 --> 00:01:38,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you startled me.</b></font>

42
00:01:38,970 --> 00:01:40,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
Glad you showed up.</b></font>

43
00:01:40,480 --> 00:01:41,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Good morning.</b></font>

44
00:01:43,690 --> 00:01:45,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Good morning, Miura.</b></font>

45
00:01:46,440 --> 00:01:48,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah!
Look who's back, baby!</b></font>

46
00:01:49,480 --> 00:01:50,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SATORU]
Kai's here, too!</b></font>

47
00:01:51,900 --> 00:01:53,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We all wanted to show up early</b></font>

48
00:01:53,360 --> 00:01:55,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to welcome you back
to our little family!</b></font>

49
00:01:56,450 --> 00:01:57,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh!
Everyone?</b></font>

50
00:01:57,990 --> 00:01:59,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Let me say--
-[TAO] You don't have to</b></font>

51
00:01:59,370 --> 00:02:00,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>say a thing.</b></font>

52
00:02:00,910 --> 00:02:03,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We already understand
how you feel, so it's fine.</b></font>

53
00:02:03,870 --> 00:02:05,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[ASUMI] Ayumi already
brought us up to speed.</b></font>

54
00:02:07,040 --> 00:02:08,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I just had
a lovely conversation</b></font>

55
00:02:08,840 --> 00:02:10,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>with your dad, Ishimori.</b></font>

56
00:02:10,170 --> 00:02:11,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Huh?</b></font>

57
00:02:11,090 --> 00:02:12,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He said
he wanted to thank everyone,</b></font>

58
00:02:13,010 --> 00:02:14,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and while he would like
to come here himself,</b></font>

59
00:02:14,840 --> 00:02:16,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>his wife vetoed that.</b></font>

60
00:02:16,260 --> 00:02:18,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>She thought he'd say
something rude again.</b></font>

61
00:02:18,100 --> 00:02:19,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[all laughing]</b></font>

62
00:02:19,810 --> 00:02:22,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Your old man is a weirdo,
but he's not that bad!</b></font>

63
00:02:22,390 --> 00:02:24,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>At least, we get
a good story out of this!</b></font>

64
00:02:24,480 --> 00:02:25,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SATORU]
For real.</b></font>

65
00:02:25,810 --> 00:02:26,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TONBO]
Couldn't be me, though!</b></font>

66
00:02:27,020 --> 00:02:29,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] All those fears
and anxieties I wanted to hide.</b></font>

67
00:02:30,280 --> 00:02:31,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YASUSHI]
Same, bro.</b></font>

68
00:02:31,570 --> 00:02:32,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-All right, get to your seat.
-[UKA] But they accept me</b></font>

69
00:02:32,650 --> 00:02:34,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-with them.
-[YUKINO] Sure thing.</b></font>

70
00:04:05,250 --> 00:04:05,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>SPARKLE 10 THE
SIDE OF YOU NO ONE KNOWS</b></font>

71
00:04:05,660 --> 00:04:07,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SHIRAISHI] Sweet, we're next
to each other again!</b></font>

72
00:04:08,250 --> 00:04:09,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
It's a fresh term.</b></font>

73
00:04:09,830 --> 00:04:11,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Mister Abe gave us
a new seating chart.</b></font>

74
00:04:11,880 --> 00:04:13,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YASUSHI] That's hilarious.
You're stuck!</b></font>

75
00:04:13,880 --> 00:04:15,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI] I don't mind
not having to move.</b></font>

76
00:04:15,960 --> 00:04:17,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MARIN]
Wait. I'm next to Kai?</b></font>

77
00:04:17,800 --> 00:04:19,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Aw, yeah!</b></font>

78
00:04:19,260 --> 00:04:20,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YASUSHI] Too bad
he hates your guts, Marin.</b></font>

79
00:04:20,970 --> 00:04:21,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MARIN]
Does not!</b></font>

80
00:04:22,140 --> 00:04:24,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We're cool, right?
You don't hate me!</b></font>

81
00:04:24,600 --> 00:04:26,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll bet you, like, love me!</b></font>

82
00:04:26,640 --> 00:04:28,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Let's go out sometime!
Yeah?</b></font>

83
00:04:28,190 --> 00:04:30,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Doesn't that sound fun?
C'mon, don't be grouchy!</b></font>

84
00:04:30,270 --> 00:04:31,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Like that,</b></font>

85
00:04:31,360 --> 00:04:32,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>he's so far away again.</b></font>

86
00:04:33,940 --> 00:04:36,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[ABE] Good on you,
staying late to catch up.</b></font>

87
00:04:36,900 --> 00:04:38,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Thank you very much, sir.</b></font>

88
00:04:38,360 --> 00:04:41,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

89
00:04:41,700 --> 00:04:43,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[door slides open]</b></font>

90
00:04:44,120 --> 00:04:45,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[breathes sharply]</b></font>

91
00:04:45,330 --> 00:04:46,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
He's still here?</b></font>

92
00:04:50,210 --> 00:04:51,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He sleeps a lot.</b></font>

93
00:04:53,630 --> 00:04:54,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Even during class.</b></font>

94
00:04:56,050 --> 00:04:57,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Maybe he doesn't get
enough at home?</b></font>

95
00:05:00,430 --> 00:05:01,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He looks so pretty.</b></font>

96
00:05:02,890 --> 00:05:03,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[breathes shakily]</b></font>

97
00:05:04,100 --> 00:05:05,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
Hold onto everyone.</b></font>

98
00:05:06,220 --> 00:05:07,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's all important.</b></font>

99
00:05:08,100 --> 00:05:09,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So...</b></font>

100
00:05:09,270 --> 00:05:10,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you'll just have
to hold onto both.</b></font>

101
00:05:11,650 --> 00:05:12,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Got it?</b></font>

102
00:05:14,900 --> 00:05:15,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Miura,</b></font>

103
00:05:16,150 --> 00:05:17,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-I love you.
-[Kai gasps]</b></font>

104
00:05:17,730 --> 00:05:18,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

105
00:05:19,610 --> 00:05:20,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[breathes in sharply]</b></font>

106
00:05:21,280 --> 00:05:22,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sighs]</b></font>

107
00:05:22,530 --> 00:05:23,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What time is it?</b></font>

108
00:05:23,910 --> 00:05:25,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uh.
It's 4:30.</b></font>

109
00:05:26,540 --> 00:05:27,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Do not panic.</b></font>

110
00:05:28,120 --> 00:05:29,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I don't think
I said that out loud.</b></font>

111
00:05:31,290 --> 00:05:32,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[breathe shakily]</b></font>

112
00:05:33,170 --> 00:05:34,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Huh?</b></font>

113
00:05:34,250 --> 00:05:35,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
Where you goin'?</b></font>

114
00:05:36,420 --> 00:05:37,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
What?</b></font>

115
00:05:37,590 --> 00:05:38,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What?</b></font>

116
00:05:39,260 --> 00:05:40,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Right.
I see.</b></font>

117
00:05:41,090 --> 00:05:42,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There's a new seating chart.</b></font>

118
00:05:42,590 --> 00:05:43,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>My bad.</b></font>

119
00:05:43,800 --> 00:05:44,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Uka breathes in sharply]</b></font>

120
00:05:47,310 --> 00:05:50,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No, uh, it's not like I don't
wanna sit next to you anymore!</b></font>

121
00:05:52,020 --> 00:05:53,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[breathes shakily]</b></font>

122
00:05:54,060 --> 00:05:55,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
Then do it.</b></font>

123
00:05:55,520 --> 00:05:56,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No one else is here.</b></font>

124
00:05:57,400 --> 00:05:58,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[exhales]</b></font>

125
00:06:00,780 --> 00:06:02,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No.
I'm okay.</b></font>

126
00:06:03,320 --> 00:06:04,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>For now.</b></font>

127
00:06:06,660 --> 00:06:08,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I'm not turning him down.</b></font>

128
00:06:08,660 --> 00:06:10,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I want to earn my place...</b></font>

129
00:06:11,000 --> 00:06:12,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and belong at his side.</b></font>

130
00:06:14,080 --> 00:06:15,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
We're doing karaoke again.</b></font>

131
00:06:15,880 --> 00:06:17,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Everyone said
they want me to bring you.</b></font>

132
00:06:19,090 --> 00:06:20,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's why I was staying late.</b></font>

133
00:06:20,460 --> 00:06:21,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Uka breathes in sharply]</b></font>

134
00:06:21,720 --> 00:06:23,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI] You still have time
to make an appearance?</b></font>

135
00:06:24,180 --> 00:06:25,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Actually.
Good news!</b></font>

136
00:06:26,010 --> 00:06:27,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>My curfew just
got pushed to later!</b></font>

137
00:06:27,720 --> 00:06:28,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh?
To when?</b></font>

138
00:06:29,310 --> 00:06:30,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Till 6:00!
-Oh.</b></font>

139
00:06:30,970 --> 00:06:32,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well, good.</b></font>

140
00:06:33,980 --> 00:06:35,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm glad you came
and woke me up when you did.</b></font>

141
00:06:36,690 --> 00:06:37,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I almost flaked on 'em.</b></font>

142
00:06:38,440 --> 00:06:40,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah, of course.
Don't think I'd ever seen you</b></font>

143
00:06:40,650 --> 00:06:41,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>fall asleep there after school.</b></font>

144
00:06:42,360 --> 00:06:44,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah. Haven't been
to the storage room</b></font>

145
00:06:44,280 --> 00:06:45,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>in a little while.</b></font>

146
00:06:45,410 --> 00:06:46,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Does she miss me?</b></font>

147
00:06:46,490 --> 00:06:47,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Storage room, miss you?</b></font>

148
00:06:47,990 --> 00:06:48,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah.</b></font>

149
00:06:49,540 --> 00:06:51,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll go tomorrow
around lunchtime.</b></font>

150
00:06:52,330 --> 00:06:53,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[breathes in sharply]
I would like to go too!</b></font>

151
00:06:54,920 --> 00:06:55,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Huh.</b></font>

152
00:06:57,420 --> 00:06:58,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And if I said no?</b></font>

153
00:06:59,210 --> 00:07:00,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But may I?</b></font>

154
00:07:01,130 --> 00:07:02,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I won't be a bother.</b></font>

155
00:07:02,710 --> 00:07:03,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll be still as a stone.</b></font>

156
00:07:05,220 --> 00:07:06,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
We've drifted a bit.</b></font>

157
00:07:07,430 --> 00:07:08,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Kai scoffs]</b></font>

158
00:07:08,720 --> 00:07:10,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
Why're you gettin' so intense?</b></font>

159
00:07:11,520 --> 00:07:12,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's okay.</b></font>

160
00:07:13,020 --> 00:07:15,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Now, I need to get close again.</b></font>

161
00:07:18,110 --> 00:07:19,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI]
Look, there they are!</b></font>

162
00:07:19,770 --> 00:07:21,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Over here, guys!</b></font>

163
00:07:21,440 --> 00:07:22,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Ayumi chuckles excitedly]</b></font>

164
00:07:22,570 --> 00:07:24,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I would've skipped
the make-up class if I knew!</b></font>

165
00:07:24,780 --> 00:07:26,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Then I'm glad
I held off on telling you!</b></font>

166
00:07:26,820 --> 00:07:28,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>'Kay, let's go!</b></font>

167
00:07:28,820 --> 00:07:30,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[door slides open]</b></font>

168
00:07:31,450 --> 00:07:32,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

169
00:07:32,790 --> 00:07:34,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[all gasp]</b></font>

170
00:07:34,450 --> 00:07:35,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hm?</b></font>

171
00:07:35,790 --> 00:07:38,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

172
00:07:39,500 --> 00:07:40,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hi, Kojima.</b></font>

173
00:07:41,460 --> 00:07:42,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What up?</b></font>

174
00:07:42,750 --> 00:07:44,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Thank you.
Last week meant a lot.</b></font>

175
00:07:45,380 --> 00:07:46,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No sweat.</b></font>

176
00:07:46,880 --> 00:07:48,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can't believe
you remember my name.</b></font>

177
00:07:49,140 --> 00:07:50,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Wouldn't ya like to forget it?</b></font>

178
00:07:50,760 --> 00:07:53,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I don't think I'll ever
be able to forget you.</b></font>

179
00:07:53,100 --> 00:07:54,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-You were my bully, after all.
-Hm?</b></font>

180
00:07:56,350 --> 00:07:57,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Remi chuckles]</b></font>

181
00:07:57,440 --> 00:07:58,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Crazy that
you talk to your bully</b></font>

182
00:07:58,900 --> 00:08:00,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>like it's no big deal,</b></font>

183
00:08:00,520 --> 00:08:01,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>let alone thank her.</b></font>

184
00:08:01,980 --> 00:08:03,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Don't you guys even care?</b></font>

185
00:08:03,530 --> 00:08:04,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Of course, we do.</b></font>

186
00:08:05,030 --> 00:08:06,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But we can't tell her
how to feel about you.</b></font>

187
00:08:07,360 --> 00:08:08,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We just follow her lead.</b></font>

188
00:08:09,490 --> 00:08:12,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Us being cool with you
is for her to decide.</b></font>

189
00:08:12,530 --> 00:08:13,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Huh.</b></font>

190
00:08:14,200 --> 00:08:16,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Why don't we all
just join hands, sing a song,</b></font>

191
00:08:16,910 --> 00:08:18,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and then go
live happily ever after?</b></font>

192
00:08:19,080 --> 00:08:21,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's just so sweet and corny,
I think I'm gonna throw up.</b></font>

193
00:08:23,170 --> 00:08:26,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey, tough guy.
I see you out at night.</b></font>

194
00:08:26,090 --> 00:08:28,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Someone's getting mixed up
with the wrong crowd.</b></font>

195
00:08:28,590 --> 00:08:29,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[gasps]
-[REMI] You slip out</b></font>

196
00:08:29,970 --> 00:08:31,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and don't come home till late.</b></font>

197
00:08:31,600 --> 00:08:33,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What are you doing?
Or...</b></font>

198
00:08:33,680 --> 00:08:36,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>maybe that world's
where you actually belong.</b></font>

199
00:08:37,230 --> 00:08:39,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey.
What does that mean?</b></font>

200
00:08:39,390 --> 00:08:40,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REMI]
Oh, nothing.</b></font>

201
00:08:40,940 --> 00:08:42,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Just a little concerned is all.</b></font>

202
00:08:42,770 --> 00:08:44,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Well, I'm freaked out.
-Let's go.</b></font>

203
00:08:46,030 --> 00:08:47,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Uka breathes shakily]
[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

204
00:08:47,490 --> 00:08:50,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

205
00:08:52,990 --> 00:08:54,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hmm.</b></font>

206
00:08:54,990 --> 00:08:56,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Tomoya chuckles]</b></font>

207
00:08:56,250 --> 00:08:57,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hmm?</b></font>

208
00:08:58,910 --> 00:09:00,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Nobody creeps me out like you!</b></font>

209
00:09:01,880 --> 00:09:04,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Bye, bye, miss second rate.</b></font>

210
00:09:07,090 --> 00:09:08,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yo.
That a new phone, dude?</b></font>

211
00:09:09,300 --> 00:09:10,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah.</b></font>

212
00:09:10,510 --> 00:09:11,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Mine flew out the window.</b></font>

213
00:09:11,970 --> 00:09:13,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SATORU]
You good, man?</b></font>

214
00:09:13,260 --> 00:09:14,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
Beats me.</b></font>

215
00:09:14,560 --> 00:09:17,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YASUSHI] Dude. Mine survived
a drop from the second floor.</b></font>

216
00:09:17,640 --> 00:09:19,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SATORU]
Kai lives nine stories up.</b></font>

217
00:09:19,770 --> 00:09:21,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I thought he lived in
a two-story building.</b></font>

218
00:09:21,980 --> 00:09:23,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Is that not true?</b></font>

219
00:09:23,110 --> 00:09:24,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SATORU]
Not anymore.</b></font>

220
00:09:24,570 --> 00:09:26,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He moved around
the end of junior high.</b></font>

221
00:09:26,650 --> 00:09:27,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KIYOSHI]
Oh.</b></font>

222
00:09:27,820 --> 00:09:29,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YASUSHI] Nice.
I'll come visit!</b></font>

223
00:09:29,490 --> 00:09:30,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Don't even try.</b></font>

224
00:09:30,700 --> 00:09:31,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YASUSHI]
You jerk.</b></font>

225
00:09:31,820 --> 00:09:33,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SATORU]
He doesn't invite anyone over,</b></font>

226
00:09:33,570 --> 00:09:34,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>not even me.</b></font>

227
00:09:34,740 --> 00:09:36,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
One minute, he's laughing.</b></font>

228
00:09:37,120 --> 00:09:39,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The next, he's lost in thought.</b></font>

229
00:09:39,080 --> 00:09:40,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[breathes sharply]</b></font>

230
00:09:40,160 --> 00:09:41,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>His expression goes cold.</b></font>

231
00:09:43,460 --> 00:09:44,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And then...</b></font>

232
00:09:44,880 --> 00:09:46,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the minute I look away,</b></font>

233
00:09:46,960 --> 00:09:47,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>he's gone.</b></font>

234
00:09:49,170 --> 00:09:50,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[panting]</b></font>

235
00:09:50,920 --> 00:09:51,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
What?</b></font>

236
00:09:52,010 --> 00:09:53,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[exhales]</b></font>

237
00:09:53,430 --> 00:09:54,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[ABE] Ishimori!
-[gasps]</b></font>

238
00:09:55,100 --> 00:09:56,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Is everything okay here?</b></font>

239
00:09:57,220 --> 00:09:58,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah.
Apparently,</b></font>

240
00:09:58,600 --> 00:10:00,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>some kid was sneaking around
the storage room,</b></font>

241
00:10:01,060 --> 00:10:03,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>so we locked it up to make sure
they couldn't get in.</b></font>

242
00:10:04,100 --> 00:10:06,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm glad that
Miura reported the issue.</b></font>

243
00:10:07,400 --> 00:10:08,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
One step forward,</b></font>

244
00:10:09,650 --> 00:10:10,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but then...</b></font>

245
00:10:11,280 --> 00:10:12,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>two steps back.</b></font>

246
00:10:12,990 --> 00:10:14,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He talks to me, then he's gone.</b></font>

247
00:10:16,490 --> 00:10:18,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>After everything
we've been through, still,</b></font>

248
00:10:19,950 --> 00:10:21,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I don't know him.</b></font>

249
00:10:24,920 --> 00:10:26,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

250
00:10:27,340 --> 00:10:28,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
It's strange.</b></font>

251
00:10:29,050 --> 00:10:30,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Is he okay?</b></font>

252
00:10:30,510 --> 00:10:31,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I shouldn't pry.</b></font>

253
00:10:32,010 --> 00:10:34,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>After all, he's the only one
who cared about that spot.</b></font>

254
00:10:35,470 --> 00:10:37,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Of course, he's free to
take it away from himself.</b></font>

255
00:10:38,180 --> 00:10:39,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[door slides open]</b></font>

256
00:10:39,350 --> 00:10:41,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Class!
Time to get started.</b></font>

257
00:10:41,520 --> 00:10:42,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[MARIN] Where's Kai?
-[SHIRAISHI] Is he sick?</b></font>

258
00:10:44,140 --> 00:10:46,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If he is, then no one told me.</b></font>

259
00:10:46,270 --> 00:10:47,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I got nada, either.</b></font>

260
00:10:47,770 --> 00:10:49,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He broke his streak
of actually coming in.</b></font>

261
00:10:49,980 --> 00:10:51,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[phone vibrates]
-Hold on!</b></font>

262
00:10:51,530 --> 00:10:52,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What's up, Kai?</b></font>

263
00:10:53,820 --> 00:10:55,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey!
You there?</b></font>

264
00:10:55,570 --> 00:10:56,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SHIRAISHI] What's wrong?
-Not gettin' a word.</b></font>

265
00:10:57,030 --> 00:10:58,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MARIN]
Put him on speaker, man!</b></font>

266
00:10:59,080 --> 00:11:00,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Sure.</b></font>

267
00:11:01,950 --> 00:11:03,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
I'm sleeping.</b></font>

268
00:11:03,160 --> 00:11:04,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>For real, bro?</b></font>

269
00:11:04,330 --> 00:11:05,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[all laugh]</b></font>

270
00:11:05,330 --> 00:11:06,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hope that explains things,
teach.</b></font>

271
00:11:07,000 --> 00:11:08,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[ABE]
All right.</b></font>

272
00:11:08,290 --> 00:11:10,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey. Shouldn't you be mad
he cut class for that?</b></font>

273
00:11:11,670 --> 00:11:14,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well, I wouldn't go so easy
on the rest of you.</b></font>

274
00:11:14,880 --> 00:11:17,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MIRU] What does that mean?
He gets special treatment?</b></font>

275
00:11:17,430 --> 00:11:18,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YASUSHI] It's just
'cause he's pretty, isn't it?</b></font>

276
00:11:19,220 --> 00:11:21,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[ABE] You caught me.
It's pretty privilege.</b></font>

277
00:11:21,890 --> 00:11:23,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Tough luck.
-[ALL] Aw!</b></font>

278
00:11:23,850 --> 00:11:24,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I've always wondered</b></font>

279
00:11:24,940 --> 00:11:26,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>why he gets
so sleepy every day.</b></font>

280
00:11:26,770 --> 00:11:28,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Probably
'cause he's out all night.</b></font>

281
00:11:28,480 --> 00:11:29,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[MARIN] Uh?
-Yeah.</b></font>

282
00:11:29,860 --> 00:11:32,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>She said he was getting in
with the wrong crowd.</b></font>

283
00:11:32,230 --> 00:11:34,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAMAKIRI] He is tough
to contact after dark.</b></font>

284
00:11:34,740 --> 00:11:36,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MIRU] Must have
some skeletons in his closet.</b></font>

285
00:11:36,820 --> 00:11:37,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TONBO]
Ya think?</b></font>

286
00:11:37,700 --> 00:11:39,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[YASUSHI] Who could say?
-All right, settle down</b></font>

287
00:11:39,490 --> 00:11:40,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>so I can take attendance!</b></font>

288
00:11:40,530 --> 00:11:42,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You and Ayumi are
the closest ones to him.</b></font>

289
00:11:42,540 --> 00:11:43,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You got any idea?</b></font>

290
00:11:44,000 --> 00:11:46,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I don't.
Not a clue.</b></font>

291
00:11:47,120 --> 00:11:48,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I never realized.</b></font>

292
00:11:48,830 --> 00:11:50,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Outside school,
I barely know him.</b></font>

293
00:11:51,300 --> 00:11:53,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MARIN] No way.
You're always around him.</b></font>

294
00:11:53,460 --> 00:11:55,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[ABE]
Okay, quiet down!</b></font>

295
00:11:57,180 --> 00:11:58,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I don't know him either.</b></font>

296
00:11:59,140 --> 00:12:00,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No one does.</b></font>

297
00:12:00,260 --> 00:12:02,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

298
00:12:02,140 --> 00:12:03,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
It's okay.</b></font>

299
00:12:03,890 --> 00:12:04,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh, Miura.</b></font>

300
00:12:05,140 --> 00:12:06,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-What's up?
-[Uka gasps]</b></font>

301
00:12:06,890 --> 00:12:07,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Uka gasps]</b></font>

302
00:12:07,980 --> 00:12:10,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI] I forgot something.
Stand guard.</b></font>

303
00:12:10,150 --> 00:12:11,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uh.
Sure.</b></font>

304
00:12:12,070 --> 00:12:13,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[door banging]</b></font>

305
00:12:13,820 --> 00:12:14,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh, come on.</b></font>

306
00:12:15,030 --> 00:12:17,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I thought I told them
the lock was broken!</b></font>

307
00:12:17,530 --> 00:12:18,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ugh, whatever.</b></font>

308
00:12:19,870 --> 00:12:20,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There.</b></font>

309
00:12:21,240 --> 00:12:22,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Got it.</b></font>

310
00:12:22,240 --> 00:12:23,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[UKA] Hold on.
-[KAI] Huh?</b></font>

311
00:12:23,620 --> 00:12:25,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] Did you find
another place to sleep?</b></font>

312
00:12:25,620 --> 00:12:26,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No.</b></font>

313
00:12:27,040 --> 00:12:28,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Then what happened?</b></font>

314
00:12:28,120 --> 00:12:29,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
Don't worry about it.</b></font>

315
00:12:30,080 --> 00:12:31,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I just felt done.</b></font>

316
00:12:31,710 --> 00:12:33,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's too dusty in there anyway.</b></font>

317
00:12:33,300 --> 00:12:34,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But, Miura...</b></font>

318
00:12:35,460 --> 00:12:36,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
What?</b></font>

319
00:12:37,470 --> 00:12:38,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
What's wrong?</b></font>

320
00:12:38,630 --> 00:12:40,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Why is he distancing us?</b></font>

321
00:12:41,430 --> 00:12:43,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm sure this spot
meant something to him.</b></font>

322
00:12:44,640 --> 00:12:46,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But I made myself
part of it without asking.</b></font>

323
00:12:47,940 --> 00:12:48,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Back then,</b></font>

324
00:12:49,480 --> 00:12:51,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>when I found the lemon soda.</b></font>

325
00:12:51,900 --> 00:12:53,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Don't hunt bottles, 'kay?</b></font>

326
00:12:54,360 --> 00:12:55,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There's no point.</b></font>

327
00:12:57,320 --> 00:12:58,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Looks like I was right.</b></font>

328
00:12:59,490 --> 00:13:01,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He's saying
not to come any closer.</b></font>

329
00:13:02,370 --> 00:13:03,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>To stay away.</b></font>

330
00:13:05,240 --> 00:13:06,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI]
What?</b></font>

331
00:13:06,250 --> 00:13:08,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're asking us
if Kai's been acting weird?</b></font>

332
00:13:08,830 --> 00:13:09,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>How would I know?</b></font>

333
00:13:10,170 --> 00:13:11,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He seems fine to me.</b></font>

334
00:13:11,790 --> 00:13:12,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But, like...</b></font>

335
00:13:13,380 --> 00:13:14,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's good.</b></font>

336
00:13:14,460 --> 00:13:16,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What's up?
Is something wrong?</b></font>

337
00:13:16,510 --> 00:13:18,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No.
It's nothing.</b></font>

338
00:13:18,550 --> 00:13:20,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uh.
That one, huh?</b></font>

339
00:13:20,340 --> 00:13:21,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah he would always say it.</b></font>

340
00:13:22,260 --> 00:13:23,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[imitating Kai]
"It's nothing."</b></font>

341
00:13:23,760 --> 00:13:26,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah. Used to be
a catchphrase for him.</b></font>

342
00:13:26,640 --> 00:13:28,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>When was the one that really
shook everyone up?</b></font>

343
00:13:29,060 --> 00:13:30,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>In third year?
Remember that?</b></font>

344
00:13:31,350 --> 00:13:32,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah!</b></font>

345
00:13:32,480 --> 00:13:34,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He just came in one day
with dyed hair.</b></font>

346
00:13:34,900 --> 00:13:36,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Seriously.
It's nothing.</b></font>

347
00:13:37,280 --> 00:13:39,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Then. He had that
same look on his face.</b></font>

348
00:13:40,780 --> 00:13:42,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What "look" are
you talking about?</b></font>

349
00:13:42,610 --> 00:13:44,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Like full deadpan?
-Bingo.</b></font>

350
00:13:45,370 --> 00:13:47,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI] He hates when people
push him for answers,</b></font>

351
00:13:47,740 --> 00:13:49,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>so we got nothing out of him.</b></font>

352
00:13:49,620 --> 00:13:50,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That sounds about right.</b></font>

353
00:13:51,330 --> 00:13:53,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He can be warm
when it comes to other people,</b></font>

354
00:13:53,830 --> 00:13:54,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but talking about him?</b></font>

355
00:13:55,290 --> 00:13:56,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You'll be lucky if you get</b></font>

356
00:13:56,250 --> 00:13:58,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>anything more than
a scary glance.</b></font>

357
00:13:59,340 --> 00:14:00,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I get it.</b></font>

358
00:14:00,920 --> 00:14:02,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I've seen that face.</b></font>

359
00:14:04,090 --> 00:14:05,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But...</b></font>

360
00:14:05,600 --> 00:14:08,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I have managed to see
some other sides of him.</b></font>

361
00:14:08,890 --> 00:14:10,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He can laugh like a kid,</b></font>

362
00:14:11,100 --> 00:14:12,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>then lose himself
in his thoughts,</b></font>

363
00:14:13,440 --> 00:14:15,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>then gives me those cold eyes.</b></font>

364
00:14:16,900 --> 00:14:18,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And every now and then,</b></font>

365
00:14:19,110 --> 00:14:21,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>he looks like
something's troubling him.</b></font>

366
00:14:22,450 --> 00:14:23,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He has a bunch of sides.</b></font>

367
00:14:26,070 --> 00:14:27,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

368
00:14:27,370 --> 00:14:28,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uh.</b></font>

369
00:14:28,450 --> 00:14:29,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Huh?</b></font>

370
00:14:31,120 --> 00:14:32,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Miura?</b></font>

371
00:14:32,580 --> 00:14:34,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I want to
get to know you better.</b></font>

372
00:14:34,960 --> 00:14:36,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I'm not trying to win anything.</b></font>

373
00:14:37,460 --> 00:14:38,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I don't need to know all of it.</b></font>

374
00:14:39,170 --> 00:14:40,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hmm.</b></font>

375
00:14:40,760 --> 00:14:41,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uh!</b></font>

376
00:14:41,840 --> 00:14:42,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Right now,</b></font>

377
00:14:42,930 --> 00:14:44,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I just want a hint...</b></font>

378
00:14:45,090 --> 00:14:47,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>of that world
he keeps to himself.</b></font>

379
00:14:47,430 --> 00:14:48,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[breathes heavily]</b></font>

380
00:14:50,100 --> 00:14:51,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REMI]
Or maybe that's the world</b></font>

381
00:14:51,810 --> 00:14:53,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>where you actually belong.</b></font>

382
00:14:54,350 --> 00:14:55,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
What is it?</b></font>

383
00:14:55,850 --> 00:14:57,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
Don't hunt bottles.</b></font>

384
00:14:58,520 --> 00:14:59,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Well,</b></font>

385
00:15:00,110 --> 00:15:01,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>too bad!</b></font>

386
00:15:02,610 --> 00:15:03,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
Third floor.</b></font>

387
00:15:03,820 --> 00:15:05,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're in room 36.</b></font>

388
00:15:05,700 --> 00:15:06,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Please follow him.</b></font>

389
00:15:07,160 --> 00:15:08,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Right this way, ladies.</b></font>

390
00:15:08,620 --> 00:15:09,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[BOTH]
Ah!</b></font>

391
00:15:09,910 --> 00:15:10,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[PATRON]
He's so hot!</b></font>

392
00:15:10,790 --> 00:15:12,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You can leave it to Kai.</b></font>

393
00:15:12,080 --> 00:15:13,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He's gettin' us some regulars!</b></font>

394
00:15:13,870 --> 00:15:15,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Those chicks were total babes!</b></font>

395
00:15:15,750 --> 00:15:16,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I should stop by.</b></font>

396
00:15:17,380 --> 00:15:19,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And there's Pineapple Earrings,
