397
00:15:19,840 --> 00:15:21,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Quit referring to girls
by what they wear.</b></font>

398
00:15:22,210 --> 00:15:23,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STUDENT 1]
How else do ya think</b></font>

399
00:15:23,300 --> 00:15:24,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm gonna tell them apart?</b></font>

400
00:15:24,550 --> 00:15:25,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[student 1 chuckles]</b></font>

401
00:15:26,550 --> 00:15:28,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

402
00:15:28,720 --> 00:15:30,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
This should be the area.</b></font>

403
00:15:30,470 --> 00:15:31,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KARASAWA]
Hey, cutie.</b></font>

404
00:15:31,810 --> 00:15:32,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

405
00:15:34,060 --> 00:15:36,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You mind?
We'd like a little word.</b></font>

406
00:15:37,980 --> 00:15:39,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STUDENT 2]
Kai,</b></font>

407
00:15:39,110 --> 00:15:40,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>there's some girl out there</b></font>

408
00:15:40,150 --> 00:15:42,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>who's been snoopin' around
and asking about you.</b></font>

409
00:15:42,860 --> 00:15:43,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What does she look like?</b></font>

410
00:15:44,320 --> 00:15:46,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Lemme think.
She had black hair</b></font>

411
00:15:46,110 --> 00:15:47,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>in a medium-length bob.</b></font>

412
00:15:47,570 --> 00:15:48,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[Kai gasps]
-Seemed kinda weird,</b></font>

413
00:15:48,780 --> 00:15:50,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but she claims
she goes to your school.</b></font>

414
00:15:51,290 --> 00:15:54,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh. Looks like
Karasawa's taking care of her.</b></font>

415
00:15:54,540 --> 00:15:55,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>All good!</b></font>

416
00:15:55,620 --> 00:15:57,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Just let your boys
handle this stuff.</b></font>

417
00:15:57,420 --> 00:15:59,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-You keep working--
-[KAI] That idiot!</b></font>

418
00:16:00,290 --> 00:16:02,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KARASAWA] Go on.
Don't make this hard on us.</b></font>

419
00:16:03,670 --> 00:16:04,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Now, mind explaining</b></font>

420
00:16:04,880 --> 00:16:06,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>what you were up to
around here?</b></font>

421
00:16:06,510 --> 00:16:08,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You stalking our boy, Kai?</b></font>

422
00:16:08,640 --> 00:16:09,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's not like that!</b></font>

423
00:16:09,890 --> 00:16:11,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh?
It's not?</b></font>

424
00:16:11,760 --> 00:16:13,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But didn't you just say
you were lookin' for him?</b></font>

425
00:16:13,810 --> 00:16:14,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yes.</b></font>

426
00:16:15,520 --> 00:16:16,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>She fessed up easy.</b></font>

427
00:16:16,890 --> 00:16:18,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Kai's lucky, isn't he?</b></font>

428
00:16:18,730 --> 00:16:19,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's unreal.</b></font>

429
00:16:20,060 --> 00:16:21,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[Karasawa chuckles softly]
-Girls freak over him.</b></font>

430
00:16:21,940 --> 00:16:24,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>How about you switch to me?</b></font>

431
00:16:24,740 --> 00:16:25,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEND 1]
She's my type.</b></font>

432
00:16:26,110 --> 00:16:27,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KARASAWA] You know she's
just a highschooler, right?</b></font>

433
00:16:28,070 --> 00:16:29,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I need to run.</b></font>

434
00:16:29,240 --> 00:16:30,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEND 2]
Who cares?</b></font>

435
00:16:30,320 --> 00:16:31,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[all laugh]</b></font>

436
00:16:32,450 --> 00:16:34,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Huh?
-Oh. Hey.</b></font>

437
00:16:34,700 --> 00:16:36,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[panting]
-[FRIEND] You good? What's up?</b></font>

438
00:16:36,250 --> 00:16:37,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Uka shudders]</b></font>

439
00:16:37,920 --> 00:16:39,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[gasps]
-[KARASAWA] Lookie here.</b></font>

440
00:16:39,750 --> 00:16:40,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Caught a stalker.</b></font>

441
00:16:41,210 --> 00:16:42,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ya mind if we take her?</b></font>

442
00:16:42,460 --> 00:16:43,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Let her go.</b></font>

443
00:16:44,090 --> 00:16:45,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Huh?</b></font>

444
00:16:45,340 --> 00:16:46,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Karasawa chokes]</b></font>

445
00:16:46,380 --> 00:16:48,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Let her go now, sir.
Okay?</b></font>

446
00:16:48,720 --> 00:16:50,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah.
Message received, bud!</b></font>

447
00:16:51,050 --> 00:16:52,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[thuds]</b></font>

448
00:16:52,140 --> 00:16:53,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
C'mon, Ishimori!</b></font>

449
00:16:54,430 --> 00:16:55,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's time to go.</b></font>

450
00:16:55,850 --> 00:16:58,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[both panting]</b></font>

451
00:16:58,980 --> 00:17:01,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

452
00:17:05,780 --> 00:17:07,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I can't tell. Is he mad?</b></font>

453
00:17:08,650 --> 00:17:09,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Sorry.</b></font>

454
00:17:09,950 --> 00:17:12,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Kai chuckles]</b></font>

455
00:17:13,080 --> 00:17:14,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So...</b></font>

456
00:17:14,160 --> 00:17:16,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>since when did you decide
to become my stalker?</b></font>

457
00:17:17,700 --> 00:17:18,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're smarter than that.</b></font>

458
00:17:19,670 --> 00:17:21,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Figured you would've
picked up on my signals.</b></font>

459
00:17:22,040 --> 00:17:23,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Huh?</b></font>

460
00:17:23,380 --> 00:17:24,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
I wanted some space.</b></font>

461
00:17:26,090 --> 00:17:27,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Not until you explain why.</b></font>

462
00:17:28,130 --> 00:17:29,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're stubborn, aren't you?</b></font>

463
00:17:30,470 --> 00:17:31,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Though,</b></font>

464
00:17:31,550 --> 00:17:33,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>guess I can blame myself
for that one.</b></font>

465
00:17:33,390 --> 00:17:34,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

466
00:17:34,470 --> 00:17:35,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
Ishimori.</b></font>

467
00:17:35,680 --> 00:17:37,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Tell me how you'd describe me.</b></font>

468
00:17:38,390 --> 00:17:39,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're very responsible.</b></font>

469
00:17:40,270 --> 00:17:41,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And very caring.</b></font>

470
00:17:42,270 --> 00:17:45,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're cool, kind, and strong.</b></font>

471
00:17:46,780 --> 00:17:47,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
Even if you believe that,</b></font>

472
00:17:48,070 --> 00:17:49,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>it's a lot to carry.</b></font>

473
00:17:49,700 --> 00:17:50,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Frankly,</b></font>

474
00:17:50,860 --> 00:17:51,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>it's heavy.</b></font>

475
00:17:52,320 --> 00:17:53,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hm?</b></font>

476
00:17:54,450 --> 00:17:55,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[exhales]</b></font>

477
00:17:55,830 --> 00:17:56,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Also,</b></font>

478
00:17:56,990 --> 00:17:58,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>even though
you're going through something,</b></font>

479
00:17:59,330 --> 00:18:00,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-you care.
-[Kai gasps]</b></font>

480
00:18:00,620 --> 00:18:03,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

481
00:18:03,130 --> 00:18:04,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[groans]</b></font>

482
00:18:04,170 --> 00:18:05,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
Hey, relax.</b></font>

483
00:18:05,880 --> 00:18:08,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Didn't have to look straight
into my heart like that.</b></font>

484
00:18:09,460 --> 00:18:10,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[breathes shakily]</b></font>

485
00:18:11,010 --> 00:18:12,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
Self-doubting.</b></font>

486
00:18:12,510 --> 00:18:13,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Anxious.</b></font>

487
00:18:14,260 --> 00:18:15,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Thinks too much.</b></font>

488
00:18:16,100 --> 00:18:17,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Martyr.</b></font>

489
00:18:17,930 --> 00:18:18,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Honest.</b></font>

490
00:18:19,560 --> 00:18:20,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Caring.</b></font>

491
00:18:22,190 --> 00:18:23,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Courageous.</b></font>

492
00:18:24,520 --> 00:18:26,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] He looked
straight into my heart...</b></font>

493
00:18:26,730 --> 00:18:28,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and told me what he saw inside.</b></font>

494
00:18:29,110 --> 00:18:30,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Now, it's my turn.</b></font>

495
00:18:31,400 --> 00:18:33,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I want to see this side of him.</b></font>

496
00:18:35,120 --> 00:18:36,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[UKA] Miura? I'm stubborn.
-[Kai gasps]</b></font>

497
00:18:37,450 --> 00:18:38,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Sorry,</b></font>

498
00:18:38,580 --> 00:18:39,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but I'm not done!</b></font>

499
00:18:41,040 --> 00:18:42,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I want to see
more of your heart.</b></font>

500
00:18:43,040 --> 00:18:46,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

501
00:18:47,710 --> 00:18:50,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

502
00:18:52,800 --> 00:18:53,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Last night,</b></font>

503
00:18:53,930 --> 00:18:55,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I learned things about him
I never knew.</b></font>

504
00:18:56,350 --> 00:18:59,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

505
00:18:59,890 --> 00:19:00,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Sorry...</b></font>

506
00:19:00,970 --> 00:19:04,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] Also, I made
a kinda weird declaration.</b></font>

507
00:19:05,150 --> 00:19:06,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YURU] Oh.
Morning, Kai!</b></font>

508
00:19:06,810 --> 00:19:07,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

509
00:19:07,980 --> 00:19:08,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Morning.</b></font>

510
00:19:10,070 --> 00:19:11,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[whimpering]</b></font>

511
00:19:11,900 --> 00:19:14,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] I feel like
I should say something to him.</b></font>

512
00:19:14,660 --> 00:19:15,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[YASUSHI] Yo, Kai!
-Hm?</b></font>

513
00:19:16,200 --> 00:19:18,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Don't tell me you're working
a part time job!</b></font>

514
00:19:19,080 --> 00:19:20,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>My friend says
he took this yesterday.</b></font>

515
00:19:21,160 --> 00:19:22,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Looks like
you're wearing a uniform,</b></font>

516
00:19:22,790 --> 00:19:24,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-and it sure isn't ours.
-[gasps]</b></font>

517
00:19:24,790 --> 00:19:26,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Are you with Ishimori?</b></font>

518
00:19:26,330 --> 00:19:28,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TONBO] Kai's a workin' man?
Wild!</b></font>

519
00:19:30,590 --> 00:19:32,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So, why didn't you
tell any of us, huh?</b></font>

520
00:19:32,800 --> 00:19:34,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I didn't realize
money was so tight.</b></font>

521
00:19:34,800 --> 00:19:36,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And I assume you knew</b></font>

522
00:19:36,340 --> 00:19:37,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>about this part-time job
all this time?</b></font>

523
00:19:37,890 --> 00:19:38,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I didn't have any idea!</b></font>

524
00:19:38,970 --> 00:19:40,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MARIN]
Well, that's an obvious lie!</b></font>

525
00:19:40,640 --> 00:19:42,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What are you
and Kai to each other?</b></font>

526
00:19:42,720 --> 00:19:44,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TAO]
Back off, Marin.</b></font>

527
00:19:44,890 --> 00:19:46,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[KAI] Yeah. Caught me.
-[gasps]</b></font>

528
00:19:47,020 --> 00:19:48,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I've got a part-time job now.</b></font>

529
00:19:48,730 --> 00:19:50,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And maybe I should've let
somebody else know that.</b></font>

530
00:19:51,020 --> 00:19:52,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[breathes heavily]</b></font>

531
00:19:52,110 --> 00:19:53,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI] But I have something
to take care of now,</b></font>

532
00:19:54,530 --> 00:19:56,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>so I'll just have
to explain later.</b></font>

533
00:19:56,360 --> 00:19:59,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

534
00:20:00,700 --> 00:20:02,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] What are Miura
and I to each other?</b></font>

535
00:20:03,950 --> 00:20:05,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I wish I could answer,</b></font>

536
00:20:05,580 --> 00:20:06,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but I can't.</b></font>

537
00:20:07,580 --> 00:20:08,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Who am I to him?</b></font>

538
00:20:09,080 --> 00:20:12,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

539
00:20:15,670 --> 00:20:16,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

540
00:20:17,050 --> 00:20:20,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

541
00:20:26,940 --> 00:20:28,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey, Miss Stubborn.</b></font>

542
00:20:28,730 --> 00:20:29,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Aren't you coming with?</b></font>

543
00:20:29,810 --> 00:20:30,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But don't you...</b></font>

544
00:20:31,570 --> 00:20:32,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
Ishimori.</b></font>

545
00:20:32,650 --> 00:20:33,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[breathes sharply]</b></font>

546
00:20:34,360 --> 00:20:35,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Come here.</b></font>

547
00:20:36,320 --> 00:20:37,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[breathes heavily]</b></font>

548
00:20:38,660 --> 00:20:40,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Who would see this side of him?</b></font>

549
00:20:41,660 --> 00:20:42,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Who would he let in?</b></font>

550
00:22:18,050 --> 00:22:19,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

551
00:22:20,090 --> 00:22:20,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
So...</b></font>

552
00:22:21,050 --> 00:22:22,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI] You can ask me
whatever you want.</b></font>

553
00:22:24,260 --> 00:22:25,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>All right.</b></font>

554
00:22:25,760 --> 00:22:26,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And you're okay with that?</b></font>

555
00:22:27,640 --> 00:22:28,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
Yeah.</b></font>

556
00:22:28,930 --> 00:22:29,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's a good thing.</b></font>

557
00:22:31,850 --> 00:22:33,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
The more I try to learn,</b></font>

558
00:22:33,440 --> 00:22:34,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the less I understand.</b></font>

559
00:22:37,860 --> 00:22:38,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ishimori?</b></font>

560
00:22:40,400 --> 00:22:41,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Want some?</b></font>

561
00:22:41,780 --> 00:22:42,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I would love some.</b></font>

562
00:22:44,450 --> 00:22:46,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
There's one thing I do know.</b></font>

563
00:22:46,780 --> 00:22:49,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>My heart is wide awake.</b></font>

564
00:22:51,290 --> 00:22:52,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

565
00:22:52,620 --> 00:22:54,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>TO BE CONTINUED</b></font>

